msgid ""
"The Chat API (like OpenAI's `Chat Completion API "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create>`__) can conduct"
" multi-turn conversations."
msgstr ""
"API de Chat (similaire à l'`API de complétion de chat "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create>`__ d'OpenAI) "
"permet des dialogues multi-tours."

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/chat.rst:27
msgid ""
"The Generate API (like OpenAI's legacy `Completions API "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/completions/create>`__) "
"allows you to generate text based on a text prompt."
msgstr ""
"L'API de génération (similaire à l'`API Completions d'OpenAI "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/completions/create>`__) vous"
" permet de générer du texte à partir d'une invite textuelle."

